VesselCharter (@neurodesk/vesselcharter)
Copyright (c) 2026 Neurodesk Contributors

Clean-room JavaScript implementation of 3D vascular morphometry algorithms
published in the scientific literature:
- Lee TC, Kashyap RL, Chu CN (1994) Building Skeleton Models via 3-D Medial
  Surface/Axis Thinning Algorithms. CVGIP 56(6):462-478.
- Felzenszwalb PF, Huttenlocher DP (2012) Distance Transforms of Sampled
  Functions. Theory of Computing 8:415-428.
- Taubin G (1995) A Signal Processing Approach to Fair Surface Design.
  SIGGRAPH 1995:351-358.
- Bullitt E, Gerig G, Pizer SM, Lin W, Aylward SR (2003) Measuring Tortuosity
  of the Intracerebral Vasculature From MRA Images. IEEE TMI 22(9):1163-1171.

External validation references (executed separately, no source code incorporated):
- scikit-image / SciPy / Skan (BSD-3-Clause)
- VesselVio (GPL-3.0, Bumgarner & Nelson 2022, Cell Reports Methods)
